OL,3,APolls close in the Holborn and St
OL,4,APancras by-election to replace Keir
OL,5,AStarmer as MP
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolls have closed in the Holborn and St
OL,8,FPancras by-election - votes will be
OL,9,Fcounted in the coming hours
OL,11,FThe seat became vacant after former
OL,12,FPrime Minister Keir Starmer announced
OL,13,Fhe was standing down from the House of
OL,14,FCommons last month
OL,16,FFifteen candidates are standing in the
OL,17,Fby-election - you can read a full list
OL,18,Fhere
OL,20,FThe result is expected to be declared
OL,21,Fbefore breakfast time on Friday
